      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LUNAR LIL (1) finds it hard to break through. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing second (17.09) at this track. Key chance in this line up. HI CHARLIE (2) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (20.45) at Capalaba behind Avalon Beach in a Grade 6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to feature again. FROG'S ROCK (7) is a consistent runner who is new here. Comes here a winner after using the inside draw to advantage last time, scoring by a neck at Capalaba over 366m (20.47). Expecting another bold showing. WINNING EDITION (3) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
